  "title": "[B-Roll] CJTF-50 Command Visits Wildfire Devastation",
  "description": "U.S. Army Gen. Charles A. Flynn, Commander U.S. Army Pacific Command, joins Joint Task Force 50 (JTF-50) in surveying the wildfire disaster and search and rescue efforts with first responders in Lahaina, Maui Aug. 15, 2023. Members of JTF-50 from the Hawaii Army and Air National Guard, U.S. Army Active Duty and Reserve are actively supporting Maui County authorities to provide immediate security, safety, and well-being to those affected by the wildfires to ensure unwavering support for the community of Maui and first responders. (U.S. Army National Guard video by Staff Sgt. Matthew A. Foster)",
